[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2641.549, "timestamp": "00:44:01", "text": "在线我可以做到这一点，所以如果我有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2645.15, "timestamp": "00:44:05", "text": "队友，我本来可以……呃……呃……如果我……如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2647.03, "timestamp": "00:44:07", "text": "和你一起的队友在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2650.99, "timestamp": "00:44:10", "text": "同一个氏族，它只是……呃，它进展了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2655.43, "timestamp": "00:44:15", "text": "任务重复两次，所以不是这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2658.829, "timestamp": "00:44:18", "text": "它这样做了 21 次，你只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2664.109, "timestamp": "00:44:24", "text": "接下来要做11次，就这些了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2668.47, "timestamp": "00:44:28", "text": "二击等于二进步"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.15, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "之所以这样，是因为我把钱花在了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2683.79, "timestamp": "00:44:43", "text": "季节性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2686.51, "timestamp": "00:44:46", "text": "把冷凝物都塞进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2689.069, "timestamp": "00:44:49", "text": "我需要在此之前完成的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2690.87, "timestamp": "00:44:50", "text": "下一个月份是二月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2694.15, "timestamp": "00:44:54", "text": "一个月后，所有这些都将实现。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2697.069, "timestamp": "00:44:57", "text": "vaed 在那个东西里，它要来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2698.67, "timestamp": "00:44:58", "text": "明白了吗？"}]